<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 4.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 4.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.24 vs     4.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.52 vs     5.15</p>
